# EDIT's pages on each engine, in order, and the parameter on each knob: the sound first, then how it plays. Knit:
# Engine, Osc 2 (interval, fine, wave, shape), Levels (osc 2, sub, noise, volume), Play; rayon and acid: Engine, Sub,
# Play, Play 2; the others: Engine, Play, Play 2. Play is the same four on every synth engine (mode, glide, bend,
# octave) and Play 2 has the volume alone, on knob 4 where knit's Levels has it. A looping sample keeps its Loop page
# second; MIDI keeps its Play (volume fourth) and Play 2 (the octave); a kit keeps Engine, Key, Sends
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
# knit
knob 3 engine knit
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
expect knobs e1 e2 e3 e4
turn SELECT 1
expect page Osc_2
expect knobs x1 fine o2wave o2shape
turn SELECT 1
expect page Levels
expect knobs x2 x3 x4 volume
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
turn SELECT -1
expect page Play
# the screen reader: the page's name, its place, its knobs
listen
turn SELECT -1
wait 400
said Levels, page 3 of 4. T3 knit, P1, S1: osc 2 0%, sub 0%, noise 0%, volume
turn SELECT -1
wait 400
said Osc 2, page 2 of 4. T3 knit, P1, S1: interval 0 st, fine 0 ct, wave same
# the knobs turn what they show
spin K1 7
expect par3.x1 71
spin K2 10
expect par3.fine 74
turn SELECT 1
spin K4 -20
expect par3.volume 80
turn SELECT 1
spin K4 -1
expect par3.oct 1
wait 40
shot knit_play.png
turn SELECT -1
knob 3 x2 90
knob 3 x3 60
wait 40
shot knit_levels.png
turn SELECT -1
wait 40
shot knit_osc2.png
# rayon and acid: Sub second
knob 3 engine rayon
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Sub
expect knobs x1 x2 x3 x4
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect knobs - - - volume
wait 40
shot play2.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
knob 3 engine acid
turn SELECT 1
expect page Sub
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect knobs - - - volume
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# the others: Engine, Play, Play 2
knob 3 engine jacquard
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect knobs - - - volume
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
knob 3 engine bellows
turn SELECT 2
expect page Play_2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
knob 3 engine cane
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 2
expect page Engine
knob 3 engine voile
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 2
expect page Engine
knob 3 engine slice
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 2
expect page Engine
# the sample: one-shot three pages, looping its Loop page second
knob 3 engine sample
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect knobs - - - volume
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
knob 3 e4 loop
turn SELECT 1
expect page Loop
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend oct
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# MIDI: as it was
knob 3 engine midi
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine_2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
expect knobs vmode porta bend volume
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect knobs oct - - -
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# a kit: Engine, Key (model, random, pan, volume), Sends (the key's)
knob 3 engine kit
turn SELECT 1
expect page Key
expect knobs d1.model d1.random d1.pan d1.volume
turn SELECT 1
expect page Sends
expect knobs d1.send1 d1.send2 - -
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# a lock editor's pages follow knit's order: a step held, EDIT, SELECT: Osc 2's interval
knob 3 engine knit
tap SEQ
expect page Steps
step 3 1 1 60 100
key w0 down
wait 60
press EDIT
wait 60
release EDIT
turn SELECT 1
wait 60
spin K1 3
wait 60
key w0 up
wait 60
expect lane 3 1 x1 1
expect lane 3 1 fine 0
